<title>USA: Alcan hikes Feb US list price 4 cents/lb.</title>
<headline>Alcan hikes Feb US list price 4 cents/lb.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alcan Aluminium Limited said its U.S. ingot list price has been raised 4 cents to 81 cents per pound, effective February 1.</p>
<p>The billet list price was raised 4 cents to 91 cents per pound, effective same date.</p>
<p>((New York Commodities 212-859-1646))</p>
</text>
